* cwht receiver front-end band-pass filter, sections 2+3+2, IF 10 MHz, stray C per section at the design-input corner (r10)
* Generated by hardware/sim/rx-frontend/make_decks.py (do not edit by hand). LTspice 26.0.2 via tools/ltspice-batch.sh.
* Topology: shunt parallel-LC resonators, top-C coupling, series-C end coupling (bpf_design.py).
* Resonator L 56 nH; coil Q QU (stepped or fixed); capacitor Q 500 (estimate); ground via 5nH per resonator.

* Ports: source RS{k} with shunt CI{k} at the section input, load RL{k} with shunt CL{k}; stray CST{k}
* from an ideal copy SGN{k} x V(i{k}) to the output (SGN 0: no leak). Values per run in the tables below.
.param QC=500 LVIA=5n
.step param run 1 5 1
.param CI1=table(run, 1,1e-21, 2,1e-21, 3,1e-21, 4,1e-21, 5,1e-21)
.param CI2=table(run, 1,-2.46584098e-12, 2,-2.46584098e-12, 3,-2.46584098e-12, 4,-2.46584098e-12, 5,-2.46584098e-12)
.param CI3=table(run, 1,-2.46584098e-12, 2,-2.46584098e-12, 3,-2.46584098e-12, 4,-2.46584098e-12, 5,-2.46584098e-12)
.param CL1=table(run, 1,-2.46584098e-12, 2,-2.46584098e-12, 3,-2.46584098e-12, 4,-2.46584098e-12, 5,-2.46584098e-12)
.param CL2=table(run, 1,-2.46584098e-12, 2,-2.46584098e-12, 3,-2.46584098e-12, 4,-2.46584098e-12, 5,-2.46584098e-12)
