V1 s1 0 AC 2
R1s s1 i1 {RS1}
C1i i1 0 {CI1}
R1l o1 0 {RL1}
C1l o1 0 {CL1}
* b1: 2-resonator top-C coupled, design BW 6.00 MHz, ripple 0.1 dB, L 56 nH
Cb1sin i1 b1r1 {4.8666p*mcsb10} Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*4.866626e-12*QC)}
Lb11 b1r1 b1g1 {56.0000n*mlb10} Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb1sh1 b1r1 b1g1 15.3838p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.538377e-11*QC)}
Lb1v1 b1g1 0 {LVIA}
