Cb2sin i2 b2r1 {4.3796p*mcsb20} Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*4.379646e-12*QC)}
Lb21 b2r1 b2g1 {56.0000n*mlb20} Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
