Lb2v1 b2g1 0 {LVIA}
Cb2k1 b2r1 b2r2 {0.8018p*mckb20} Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*8.017836e-13*QC)}
Lb22 b2r2 b2g2 {56.0000n*mlb21} Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb2sh2 b2r2 b2g2 19.6205p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.962047e-11*QC)}
Lb2v2 b2g2 0 {LVIA}
Cb2k2 b2r2 b2r3 {0.8018p*mckb21} Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*8.017836e-13*QC)}
Lb23 b2r3 b2g3 {56.0000n*mlb22} Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb2sh3 b2r3 b2g3 16.2125p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.621246e-11*QC)}
Lb2v3 b2g3 0 {LVIA}
Cb2sout b2r3 o2 {4.3796p*mcsb21} Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*4.379646e-12*QC)}
Est2 x2 0 i2 0 {SGN2}
Cst2 x2 o2 {CST2}
V3 s3 0 AC 2
R3s s3 i3 {RS3}
C3i i3 0 {CI3}
R3l o3 0 {RL3}
C3l o3 0 {CL3}
* b3: 2-resonator top-C coupled, design BW 6.00 MHz, ripple 0.1 dB, L 56 nH
