Lb31 b3r1 b3g1 {56.0000n*mlb30} Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb3sh1 b3r1 b3g1 15.3838p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.538377e-11*QC)}
Lb3v1 b3g1 0 {LVIA}
